WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.360
I want to take up in Volume 13 at January the 28th, 1922, how Jesus opened for us many

2
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.640
founds in his divine will.

3
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:28.360
Louisa said, "I was praying and my sweet Jesus drew me to himself and transforming me

4
00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:32.440
completely into himself," he told me.

5
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:40.040
Now, this is the issue for us, that we have to be transformed completely into Jesus.

6
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.680
We have to become other Christs.

7
00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:54.400
So that we look like him, what I mean by that is the expression is his, the look is his,

8
00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:02.000
the gaze is his, the word is his, the works are his, the thoughts are his, we've got to

9
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:11.080
be transformed completely into him and the way we do it is that we fuse as often as possible.

10
00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:16.600
So Jesus said, "My daughter, let us pray together."

11
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:22.320
Now I want to give you Matthew 18, verses 19 to 20 where Jesus said that if two of us

12
00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:27.760
come together, if two of you, sorry, come together, I am in the midst of you.

13
00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:35.400
So here's Louisa praying with him for whatever God is wanting at this point.

14
00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:42.320
Let us pray together so as to hold heaven in our power, look at that, to pray with Jesus

15
00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:46.640
is to hold heaven in your power.

16
00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:52.200
And it is to prevent the earth from falling even more into the current of evil.

17
00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:58.000
Now this is power where power actually exists.

18
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.280
If you want to know how to influence the earth, let's stop talking about the things

19
00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:06.320
that everybody else is talking about and thinking the way they're thinking and just

20
00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:16.360
get on with, let us get on with praying through with and in Jesus in the divine will because

21
00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:22.600
you hold heaven in your power and you can prevent more evil upon the earth.

22
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.920
I think that's fantastic.

23
00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.640
So Louisa said, "We prayed together."

24
00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:36.320
And then Jesus added, "While on earth my humanity saw itself as very narrow before the divinity."

25
00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:43.840
So this is the limitation of human flesh and he's trying to tell us that our sense that

26
00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:50.120
we have of ourselves as nothing in miserable, small and how could you possibly have these

27
00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:55.480
great effects upon heaven and earth that that is understandable.

28
00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:03.080
And we just accept his word that we can go beyond that and have this great effect upon

29
00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:06.520
the world.

30
00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:13.600
While on earth he said, "My humanity saw itself as very narrow before the divinity."

31
00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:19.760
And since my humanity was inseparable from the divinity because he had the hypostatic

32
00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:31.320
union that's H-Y-P-O-S-T-A-T-I-C hypostatic union, he said, "I did nothing but enter into

33
00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.840
the immensity of the eternal will.

34
00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:37.280
He's telling us what to do.

35
00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.240
We do what he did.

36
00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.160
We echo everything that he did and said."

37
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:50.440
So he said, "Because my humanity saw itself very narrow before the divinity, but it was

38
00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:55.960
inseparable from the divinity, so he said, 'I did nothing except enter into the immensity

39
00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.360
of the eternal will.'

40
00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:01.000
We call that fusing."

41
00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:07.280
And he said, "I did nothing other but open many founds for the good of creatures.

42
00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:13.480
See, everything is for God's glory and for the salvation of the human race."

43
00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:21.280
In fact, Jesus said, "Since they were being opened by a man-god, I could give the human

44
00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:28.320
family the right to approach these funds and to take whatever they wanted."

45
00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:35.880
Now, this invitation has been given at different levels throughout salvation history.

46
00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:42.920
So I want to give you Isaiah 12-3, "Come and drink deeply from the wells of salvation."

47
00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:51.400
The beauty for us living in the divine will is that when we go back and read something

48
00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:56.760
like Isaiah 12-3, Isaiah read it at the level he was at.

49
00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:59.600
The people read that at the level they were at.

50
00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:03.800
The saints in the New Testament read that at the level they were at in redemption, and

51
00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:10.120
now we read it at the level we're at in divine will, as the same text from the same God who

52
00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.080
knew that all these levels were there.

53
00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:17.920
Because that's one of the things we know about God's holy word, and that is that there

54
00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.840
are many levels in it.

55
00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:26.240
And it's only as you yourself shift from one level to another that you begin to appreciate

56
00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:31.960
the fact that God's word incorporated the new level that you're at as well.

57
00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:38.480
And it has incorporated the highest level that we are called to drink deeply from the

58
00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.280
divine will.

59
00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:43.680
It's wonderful.

60
00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:47.640
And they can take whatever they want, he said.

61
00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:52.880
And we've heard him say to Louisa, "Come and take as much as you want.

62
00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.680
I'm delighted if you take more."

63
00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:03.160
Therefore, Jesus said, "I formed the fount of love, the fount of prayer, the fount of

64
00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:10.160
reparation, the fount of forgiveness, the fount of my, we say, precious blood, and the

65
00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.080
fount of my glory."

66
00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:19.880
So there are all these founts, and different people are led to dig more deeply into one

67
00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:20.880
or the other.

68
00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:24.000
I don't know how many dig into them all.

69
00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:30.280
But I want to give you John 7, 37 to 39, where again Jesus said, "Come and drink from

70
00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.960
this fount."

71
00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:38.240
And eventually you will be so overflowing that out of your own heart will flow fountains

72
00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:42.000
of living water for others.

73
00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.160
Everything is for others.

74
00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:50.720
It's for God's glory on the one side, and it's for the salvation of souls on the other.

75
00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:57.320
Now, do you want to know who agitates these founts as to make them rise and overflow in

76
00:06:57.320 --> 00:07:02.000
such a way that all the earth may be inundated, Jesus said?

77
00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.200
Excuse me?

78
00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:09.040
He said, "Do you want to know who agitates these founts?

79
00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.640
These founts exist?

80
00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.560
Who makes them overflow?

81
00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:18.360
It is the soul who enters into my will.

82
00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:21.680
That's us who fuse in the divine will.

83
00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:27.520
And as the soul enters, if she wants to love, she approaches the fount of love.

84
00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:34.640
And by loving or even placing the intention to love, I think that's fantastic.

85
00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:39.560
If you even place the intention to love, it has the same effect.

86
00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.840
I think that's fantastic.

87
00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:46.960
He's made it so easy for us.

88
00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:51.840
And by placing the intention to love, she agitates the fount.

89
00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:57.560
Being agitated, the waters swell, they overflow, and they flood the whole earth.

90
00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:05.360
Now, we've all got used to the teaching here that everything we do in the divine will

91
00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:08.880
affect every soul past, present, and future.

92
00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:15.360
And that, I find, is one of the most attractive things in this divine will mission that we

93
00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.120
have.

94
00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:21.680
Because I've always worried about all the generations that went before us.

95
00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:25.280
I'm not even thinking of Christian generations.

96
00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:31.760
I'm not even thinking of the Jewish people, the chosen people who had the covenant with

97
00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:32.760
Moses.

98
00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:37.200
I'm thinking of all the people before that.

99
00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:45.000
And all the people who, even now, up to the 20th century afterwards, do not know the Christ.

100
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.960
Do not know this treasure.

101
00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:50.000
They're the ones I worry about.

102
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.520
And it's not just today or yesterday I worried about it.

103
00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:57.600
I've been worrying about it since I was a very small child.

104
00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:04.240
And I remember telling my father when I was only about six or seven years of age, that

105
00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:10.080
I was having nightmares about all the millions of people who were going to hell because they

106
00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.440
didn't know Jesus.

107
00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:15.640
And they were not able to drink from this fountain.

108
00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:22.200
And my dad, who knew his scriptures, brought me to John chapter 10, and I think it's verse

109
00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:30.400
10, "other sheep I have that do not belong to this fold, and them also I will bring."

110
00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:38.640
And that was, I think, the first conscious verse of scripture that I took into my being

111
00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:45.420
and slept with it at night, I could sleep if there were other sheep that he would bring

112
00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:48.680
into his fold.

113
00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:54.280
And that's why I find it so attractive in the divine will, that the other sheep includes

114
00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:57.880
everybody.

115
00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:02.560
Those ancient pharaohs who worshiped the sun because they didn't know there was a maker

116
00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:11.160
for the sun, they just didn't get back that other step, and it would break me completely

117
00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:17.920
that they would be lost eternally just because they couldn't make that other step.

118
00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:24.240
And all the people of all the ancient religions who managed to touch some truths but didn't

119
00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:29.000
get through to the fullness.

120
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:34.040
But now in the divine will we can pass all this grace and all this blessing and all this

121
00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:37.800
understanding absolutely everything to them.

122
00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:43.440
I think what's going to shock us when we arrive in heaven is to see just how many people

123
00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:48.400
are there, and they will say, "I'm here because of you."

124
00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:51.600
Thank you.

125
00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:58.360
So Jesus says, "The waters, when they are agitated, they swell and they overflow to flood

126
00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.480
the whole earth."

127
00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:06.040
Sometimes this agitating is so intense he says that the waves rise up so high that they

128
00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:11.440
actually touch heaven and they flood the celestial fatherland as well.

129
00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:18.360
Now notice he says, "Sometimes," he doesn't say it happens all the time.

130
00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:25.880
Sometimes the intensity of our prayer is not as deep as others.

131
00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:30.020
Sometimes the intensity of our prayer can go very deep.

132
00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.160
Sometimes it can be quite superficial.

133
00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:39.160
So he says, "Sometimes this agitating is so intense that the waves rise up so high as

134
00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:43.080
to touch heaven and flood the celestial fatherland."

135
00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:49.880
So if the soul wants to pray or repair or ask for forgiveness for sinners or to give

136
00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:56.640
Jesus glory, she agitates the founts of prayer, reparation or forgiveness.

137
00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:01.200
And they rise and they overflow and they flood everyone.

138
00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:06.480
So how many goods did my humanity not impotray for man?

139
00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:14.120
I left the doors open," he said, "so that they might enter and with all ease."

140
00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.640
It's very wonderful.

141
00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:21.280
Jesus left the doors open for us to enter into the divine will.

142
00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:27.200
He left his tomb open so that we could enter into the resurrection.

143
00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:33.080
And he tells us in Revelation chapter 3 verse 20 that he's always knocking at the doors

144
00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:36.680
of our hearts to ask us to open.

145
00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.480
He's open, but are we?

146
00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:45.920
And the problem we have in a society that has degenerated as much as today is that hearts

147
00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:51.480
have closed to Christ and they're closing more and more and more.

148
00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:54.360
Christ is being eliminated from the earth.

149
00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.800
He's opened, they're closed.

150
00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:05.880
So the few that are open need to open more and more and more to affect everybody else.

151
00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:10.680
So he said, "I left the doors open so that they can come in with all ease, but how few

152
00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:15.880
are those who actually do enter."

153
00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:19.840
So let's come to January the 30th, 1922.

154
00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:23.080
The truths are new creations.

155
00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:25.680
This is very, very interesting.

156
00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:30.600
And the truth is light and light extends by itself.

157
00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:37.880
So he's explaining how it is that here in the privacy of my own house that I can fuse

158
00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:46.040
and make these acts in the divine will and that they will diffuse to absolutely everybody.

159
00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:51.000
So Louisa said, "As I was in my usual state, my adorable Jesus came.

160
00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:56.520
And seeing me all reluctant to manifest and write what he tells me with such an imposing

161
00:13:56.520 --> 00:14:03.840
look as to make me tremble," he said, "My daughter, my word is creative.

162
00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:07.520
I want to give you Hebrews 4, 12.

163
00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:10.480
The Word of God is alive and active.

164
00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:13.160
It cuts like any double-edged sword.

165
00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.040
It can get through the place that divides the soul from the spirit and joints from the

166
00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.040
marrow.

167
00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:24.440
And no created thing can hide from him before whom we have to give an account of ourselves.

168
00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:28.440
The Word of God is an "it" and a "him."

169
00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:31.440
It's an "it" in the Bible.

170
00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:35.840
It's a "him" in the Word incarnate.

171
00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:44.360
So we have to understand that the Bible, the words we read in the Bible are Jesus.

172
00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:50.840
And what we receive in the Eucharist is the same Jesus incarnate.

173
00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.680
It's the Word and the Word.

174
00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:59.840
And we see that in Genesis chapter 1, the "I want" of God created absolutely everything

175
00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.720
brought everything into being.

176
00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:09.280
We see in the Gospels that the "I want" of the God incarnate, heal the sick and raise

177
00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:15.280
the dead and cleanse the lepers and forgave everybody.

178
00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:17.840
So the Word of God is creative.

179
00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:22.840
So let me give you an example in your own personal life.

180
00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:30.560
If God actually speaks to you, many people imagine that God speaks to them.

181
00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:34.240
But you can discern whether he has or he hasn't.

182
00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:44.560
If God has actually spoken to you, it is completely and totally impossible to erase those words.

183
00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:48.440
Those words become flesh inside of you.

184
00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:52.440
They become part of your being.

185
00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:58.880
So if God says to you, "Forgive."

186
00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:02.060
That forgiveness becomes part of your being.

187
00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:09.800
And that forgiveness becomes part of who you are.

188
00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:14.560
And he empowers you to forgive.

189
00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:24.560
I think that we who live in the divine will must become forgiveness as Jesus became forgiveness.

190
00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:30.760
And we must forgive everybody we've ever met, every man, woman and child ever involved in

191
00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:36.680
our lives, even if you met them just in passing on the street.

192
00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.480
We must forgive, forgive, forgive, forgive, forgive.

193
00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:44.280
It's the key to heaven and it's the key to earth.

194
00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:48.600
Forgiveness is the heroic face of love.

195
00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:55.280
And when we forgive in the divine will, we can smile at Jesus and say, "You and I give

196
00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:58.680
them divine forgiveness."

197
00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:03.720
So I make sure I do an exercise on that every single night.

198
00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:09.120
Every single human being from Adam to Zachary is not only given his divine forgiveness but

199
00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:15.360
mine in his, my little drop of water in the wine of his forgiveness.

200
00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:19.440
Extremely important, extremely important.

201
00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:26.560
Of all the things that our human race needs more than anything else, it's forgiveness.

202
00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:31.480
Because forgiveness will release them to begin looking at God.

203
00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:35.360
So Jesus says, "My daughter, my word is creative.

204
00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:42.620
And when I speak, making known a truth that belongs to me, it is nothing less than new

205
00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:48.600
divine creations that I make in the soul."

206
00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:54.120
And just as when I created the heavens with one single fiat, I stretched them out and

207
00:17:54.120 --> 00:18:00.040
I stood them with billions of stars, so much so there's not one place of the earth from

208
00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.920
which this heaven cannot be seen.

209
00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:10.120
And if some parts it could not be seen, it would be a dishonor for the creative power.

210
00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:17.020
And some could say that the creative force did not have the power to extend everywhere.

211
00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:22.740
So for all of that I want to give you Luke 1, 37, nothing is impossible with God.

212
00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:30.200
And Luke 18, 27, when you pray in the divine will, nothing is impossible.

213
00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.520
Very important.

214
00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:39.400
In the same way he said, "My truths are more than heavens, which I would want to make known

215
00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:48.000
to all from one end of the earth to the other, to make them pass from mouth to mouth like

216
00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:53.200
many stars, to adorn the heaven of the truths that I manifested."

217
00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:58.040
So here's Jesus saying, "Absolutely he wants these truths to go from mouth to mouth.

218
00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:03.160
He wants eventually everybody to know."

219
00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:09.040
It seems in an almighty task at this particular point, but that's nothing to him.

220
00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.120
There's nothing impossible with God.

221
00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.240
And that's the beauty we don't have to worry.

222
00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:20.760
We only have to do what we can do in our circumstances.

223
00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:26.680
If the creature wanted to hide my truths, that's like putting the lamp under the lampstand.

224
00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:33.760
So I want to give you Matthew 5, verses 14 to 17 there.

225
00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:40.560
Your light is to shine before everyone so that they will see and give glory to God.

226
00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:41.560
And that light is the truth.

227
00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.880
