00:39:31.440 --> 00:39:38.360
But you can only do it within the wheel of eternity therefore inside of the divine will.

457
00:39:38.360 --> 00:39:44.640
And so we fill up all the voids for the people in the past and the present and the future

458
00:39:44.640 --> 00:39:49.280
and the voids in our own lives as well.

459
00:39:49.280 --> 00:39:57.920
And they redo what has not been done by creatures or how beautiful it is to see a soul enter

460
00:39:57.920 --> 00:40:00.680
into my will.

461
00:40:00.680 --> 00:40:06.820
As she enters the great wheel of eternity winds her up, I love that expression.

462
00:40:06.820 --> 00:40:13.120
The great wheel of eternity winds her up to make her go around within its great expanse

463
00:40:13.120 --> 00:40:17.080
and the little wheel does its eternal rounds.

464
00:40:17.080 --> 00:40:28.000
We say I love you to him for everybody and for everything forever and we love it.

465
00:40:28.000 --> 00:40:34.120
The winding of the great wheel puts her in communication with all the divine windings

466
00:40:34.120 --> 00:40:39.440
and while she goes round she does all that her Creator himself does.

467
00:40:39.440 --> 00:40:44.000
He's sending his I love yous to us through all of creation and through everything that

468
00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:50.120
he's providing for us and we return the I love yous back to him in the name of all.

469
00:40:50.120 --> 00:40:57.520
Therefore they are as though the first and the last to be created by me.

470
00:40:57.520 --> 00:41:03.920
First because we go ahead to do it for everybody and the last is that we bring everybody in

471
00:41:03.920 --> 00:41:10.520
because in going around they find themselves at the beginning, in the middle and at the

472
00:41:10.520 --> 00:41:11.520
end.

473
00:41:11.520 --> 00:41:14.320
Excuse me for using an awful image here.

474
00:41:14.320 --> 00:41:21.000
The image of the sheep dog who rounds up the sheep, gathers them all, gets them through

475
00:41:21.000 --> 00:41:26.200
the gate, gets them out of where they have to go and goes behind them to make sure they

476
00:41:26.200 --> 00:41:27.960
actually do it.

477
00:41:27.960 --> 00:41:31.560
And if any of them are straying then the sheep dog goes along the side and puts them back

478
00:41:31.560 --> 00:41:34.920
into the herd.

479
00:41:34.920 --> 00:41:42.280
Therefore, they are as though the first and the last to be created by me because in going

480
00:41:42.280 --> 00:41:46.960
around they find themselves at the beginning, in the middle and at the end.

481
00:41:46.960 --> 00:41:51.960
So they will be like the crown of the whole human family.

482
00:41:51.960 --> 00:41:58.440
They will be the glory, the honor and the substitution of all.

483
00:41:58.440 --> 00:42:04.640
And they return to God of the whole order of things created by Him.

484
00:42:04.640 --> 00:42:07.040
What a mission to have.

485
00:42:07.040 --> 00:42:12.800
Therefore let your rounds be continuous in my will.

486
00:42:12.800 --> 00:42:20.640
I will give you the winding and you will be ready to receive it, won't you, he says.

487
00:42:20.640 --> 00:42:26.280
And then he added, "You've not spoken about all the rounds that the little wheel of your

488
00:42:26.280 --> 00:42:29.460
will does within the great wheel of eternity."

489
00:42:29.460 --> 00:42:34.960
And Louisa replied, "How could I speak about them if I don't know?"

490
00:42:34.960 --> 00:42:43.520
And Jesus said, "As the soul enters into my will, even with the simple adhesion, with

491
00:42:43.520 --> 00:42:51.240
an abandonment, he's not saying you've got to be saying words morning, noon and night.

492
00:42:51.240 --> 00:42:56.040
Because in the spiritual realm, words aren't actually necessary.

493
00:42:56.040 --> 00:43:04.480
The intention, the connection, the adhesion to his will, he says, "This does it."

494
00:43:04.480 --> 00:43:07.560
I don't know if that releases you from the big burden of, "I have to do my rounds, I

495
00:43:07.560 --> 00:43:11.280
have to do my rounds, I have to do my rounds."

496
00:43:11.280 --> 00:43:15.760
Because we're so silly, we think that everything has to be in human words.

497
00:43:15.760 --> 00:43:20.720
Know you can take the whole thing, I just say to Him, "I love you for everything.

498
00:43:20.720 --> 00:43:23.720
I love you in the name of everyone.

499
00:43:23.720 --> 00:43:28.820
I bring them all into my arms and into your arms."

500
00:43:28.820 --> 00:43:32.840
It's much simpler than people are making out.

501
00:43:32.840 --> 00:43:39.440
He says, "As the soul enters into my will, even with the simple adhesion, with an abandonment,

502
00:43:39.440 --> 00:43:43.320
I wind her so as to make her go round.

503
00:43:43.320 --> 00:43:46.000
And do you know how many times she goes round?

504
00:43:46.000 --> 00:43:52.240
She goes round as many times for as many thinking intelligences, for as many gazes as creatures

505
00:43:52.240 --> 00:43:56.840
give, for as many words as they speak, for as many works as they do, and as many steps

506
00:43:56.840 --> 00:43:57.840
as they take.

507
00:43:57.840 --> 00:44:02.080
Well, if that all had to be put into words, you'd never stop talking.

508
00:44:02.080 --> 00:44:06.760
And even with all the talking, you'd never cover it."

509
00:44:06.760 --> 00:44:11.840
It's done by entering into the divine will.

510
00:44:11.840 --> 00:44:18.360
They go round in each divine act, in each motion, at each gaze which descends from heaven.

511
00:44:18.360 --> 00:44:26.160
In some, they form their round in anything that is done in heaven and on earth.

512
00:44:26.160 --> 00:44:33.760
The rounds of these little wheels are fast and rapid so that they cannot calculate them

513
00:44:33.760 --> 00:44:38.360
as Louisa has just said, "How can I talk about it if I don't know?"

514
00:44:38.360 --> 00:44:42.120
But I count them all, he said, "That's Luke 12, 7."

515
00:44:42.120 --> 00:44:44.960
He counts even the hairs on our head.

516
00:44:44.960 --> 00:44:51.200
First, I count them to take the glory and the eternal love that they give me.

517
00:44:51.200 --> 00:45:00.000
And then to fuse all the eternal good, and then to give them the capacity of surpassing

518
00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:11.760
everything, then to be able to embrace everyone and finally to become the crown of everything.

519
00:45:11.760 --> 00:45:14.600
You only need to read that slowly.

520
00:45:14.600 --> 00:45:20.080
If you want to write it down in a notebook, sometimes I find it's much easier if you

521
00:45:20.080 --> 00:45:27.120
just label it 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, and then the enormity of what you're reading actually

522
00:45:27.120 --> 00:45:29.480
hits you.

523
00:45:29.480 --> 00:45:32.680
But now we've come to the end of Volume 13.

524
00:45:32.680 --> 00:45:34.280
God bless.
